message: "Please cite this research software and its archived release."
type: software
title: "Reproducible analysis of generative AI use and student achievement in PISA 2025"
authors:
  - family-names: "González Ali"
    given-names: "Pedro Gustavo"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0630-8703"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-12
repository-code: "https://github.com/pegus/pisa2025-ai-use-achievement"
url: "https://github.com/pegus/pisa2025-ai-use-achievement"
license: MIT
abstract: "Reproducible, noncausal analysis of self-reported AI use and PISA 2025 reading, mathematics and science achievement. Country-specific weighted categorical models, 10 plausible values, 80 Fay replicate weights, selection audits and sensitivity analyses. No individual microdata are redistributed."
keywords:
  - PISA 2025
  - artificial intelligence
  - educational achievement
  - plausible values
  - survey inference
